    "Description": "Advanced Intrusion Detection Environment (AIDE) is a utility that creates a database of files on the system, and then uses that database to ensure file integrity and detect system intrusions.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* aide: improper output neutralization enables bypassing (CVE-2025-54389)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
